<title>USA: NYSE CLOSING AVERAGES.</title>
<headline>NYSE CLOSING AVERAGES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 30.89 to 8062.11.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.42 to 485.21.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.14.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 1483 to 1344.</p>
<p>Volume was 480,337,200 compared with 561,302,610 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
